{"unit_id":"robin421__dsh-html-inspector#card-zh","repo":"robin421/dsh-html-inspector","commit":"040c7d4c678d1330ef3fa0fad5a36fa944bc49b7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-html-inspector 是供 DSH Web 客户端使用的 HTML 页面选区插件。它为本机网页提供注入检查脚本的代理路由，并在文件树 HTML 预览中注入同类脚本；用户悬停可高亮元素，点击后将 CSS 选择器、文本和 HTML 片段写入当前会话输入框。地址栏本机 URL 会改走代理，工具栏可切换选区模式，Escape 可取消。适合根据本地演示页面元素向 agent 描述修改目标；不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-88","index.js:128-148","client.js:224-267","client.js:404-479"]}
{"unit_id":"robin421__dsh-html-inspector#card-en","repo":"robin421/dsh-html-inspector","commit":"040c7d4c678d1330ef3fa0fad5a36fa944bc49b7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-html-inspector lets DSH web users select elements in local pages and previews. Hover to highlight; click to add the selector, text, and HTML to chat. A toolbar toggle controls selection mode; Escape cancels. It helps users point an agent to a demo element.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-88","index.js:128-148","client.js:224-267","client.js:404-479"]}
