{"unit_id":"robin421__dsh-html-inspector#feature-1","repo":"robin421/dsh-html-inspector","commit":"040c7d4c678d1330ef3fa0fad5a36fa944bc49b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-html-inspector 的功能「点击定位页面元素」：开启选区模式后，悬停会高亮元素，点击会捕获 CSS 选择器、可见文本和 HTML 片段，并将其加入当前会话输入框。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:17-33","client.js:233-263"]}
