{"unit_id":"robin421__dsh-html-inspector#caveat-1","repo":"robin421/dsh-html-inspector","commit":"040c7d4c678d1330ef3fa0fad5a36fa944bc49b7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-html-inspector 会通过 DSH 本机代理读取用户指定的 loopback HTTP 页面，并把选区内容放入会话输入；实现中未配置外部服务或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:112-120","client.js:258-263"]}
